          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "The Spanish message says:\n\n> **\"Start\"**\n>\n> **\"What is this about? If there is someone who can help me and explain it to me, please.\"**\n\nA natural English translation would be:\n\n> **\"What is this about? Is there someone who can help me and explain it to me, please?\"**\n\nIf you're replying about The Luxora Collective or your Revenue Leak Audit, you could respond in Spanish:\n\n> **Hola Cuauht\u00e9moc, gracias por escribir. Nosotros ayudamos a due\u00f1os de negocios a identificar oportunidades de crecimiento y posibles p\u00e9rdidas de ingresos. Con gusto puedo explicarte c\u00f3mo funciona y responder cualquier pregunta que tengas. \u00bfTienes unos minutos para platicar?**\n\nTranslation:\n\n> **Hi Cuauht\u00e9moc, thanks for reaching out. We help business owners identify growth opportunities and potential revenue losses. I'd be happy to explain how it works and answer any questions you have. Do you have a few minutes to chat?**"
